# The partner repositories molvis's Python package is built against, checked
# out next to this repository (../molrs, ../molpy, ../mollog, ../molcfg) by
# MolCrafts/molcrafts-ci/actions/setup-partners in test.yml, and the local
# hooks resolve them from the same declared refs. python/pyproject.toml builds molrs and molpy from
# those checkouts ([tool.uv.sources]); molpy's own sources pull in mollog and
# molcfg from theirs, so they are checked out too.
#
# KEY=VALUE lines only. Each ref is used exactly as declared. This batch
# pins the MolRS -> MolPy -> MolVis integration chain to published commits,
# including MolPy's mollog/molcfg inputs. No implicit branch override is used.
#
# python/uv.lock records the partners' package metadata (version and
# dependencies), not a commit. When a partner's dev changes that metadata,
# `uv lock --check` fails; relock in a commit of its own.
#
# The npm side is not tracked here: the TypeScript packages build against the
# published @molcrafts/molrs (core/package.json).
SELF=molvis
CI_PROFILE=node-python
MOLRS_REPOSITORY=MolCrafts/molrs
MOLRS_REF=aa4c935c3d8f7f31a33df21df2bcf118fbdd973d
MOLPY_REPOSITORY=MolCrafts/molpy
MOLPY_REF=bdcbd390a328e112e2348456708060b4754060e1
MOLLOG_REPOSITORY=MolCrafts/mollog
MOLLOG_REF=ed4015e67e203de7074c9a3a5364309920d9a203
MOLCFG_REPOSITORY=MolCrafts/molcfg
MOLCFG_REF=c169ae1489ee44e11fea7a244c8085069595d506
CI_REF=01317cbc43f961ab14c35d51d48c081a1acfe815
